    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.05e0929fd7d046368c5d5682fe84ea55",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 10,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "and large black holes can have tens to millions of times the mass of our sun",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "v\u00E0 c\u00E1c h\u1ED1 \u0111en l\u1EDBn c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 ch\u1EE9a kh\u1ED1i l\u01B0\u1EE3ng g\u1EA5p h\u00E0ng ch\u1EE5c \u0111\u1EBFn h\u00E0ng tri\u1EC7u l\u1EA7n M\u1EB7t Tr\u1EDDi",
        "StartTime": 59,
        "EndTime": 64.9
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.073d19fff68c4a38ac3f17dd34df13d1",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 2,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "Space is a pretty dark place. Even so, some areas are darker than others.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Kh\u00F4ng gian l\u00E0 m\u1ED9t n\u01A1i kh\u00E1 t\u1ED1i. D\u00F9 v\u1EADy, c\u00F3 nh\u1EEFng v\u00F9ng c\u00F2n t\u1ED1i h\u01A1n nh\u1EEFng v\u00F9ng kh\u00E1c.",
        "StartTime": 9,
        "EndTime": 18.8
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.0e5ee266d76b45179facdafac4cf6572",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 6,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "The energy that held the star together disappears and it collapses in on itself producing a magnificent explosion.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "N\u0103ng l\u01B0\u1EE3ng gi\u1EEF ng\u00F4i sao k\u1EBFt l\u1EA1i bi\u1EBFn m\u1EA5t v\u00E0 n\u00F3 s\u1EE5p v\u00E0o ch\u00EDnh m\u00ECnh, t\u1EA1o ra m\u1ED9t v\u1EE5 n\u1ED5 ngo\u1EA1n m\u1EE5c.",
        "StartTime": 32,
        "EndTime": 41.6
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.0edce92f35e043a5a89af59b8f6b64fd",
      "kind": "ListeningVocabItem",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 4,
        "Word": "singularity",
        "Definition": "\u0111i\u1EC3m k\u1EF3 d\u1ECB",
        "ExampleSentence": "The point where all that mass is trapped is called a singularity.",
        "ImageUrl": null
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.22a5dc3edc5f406ca1149cbb9003c858",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 22,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "that it will get completely stretched out like a piece of spaghetti.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "\u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c con t\u00E0u s\u1EBD b\u1ECB k\u00E9o d\u00E0i ho\u00E0n to\u00E0n nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t s\u1EE3i m\u00EC \u1ED1ng.",
        "StartTime": 130.9,
        "EndTime": 134.8
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.2446f37331d4466ea445b8264fa7f506",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 5,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "Black holes form at the end of some stars\u2019 lives.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "H\u1ED1 \u0111en h\u00ECnh th\u00E0nh \u1EDF cu\u1ED1i v\u00F2ng \u0111\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a m\u1ED9t s\u1ED1 ng\u00F4i sao.",
        "StartTime": 29.5,
        "EndTime": 32
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.25ae8fb3d0de4bdfa1c55bf1997c9ed9",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 16,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "That\u0027s why it\u0027s black! This circle is known as the event horizon.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "\u0110\u00F3 l\u00E0 l\u00FD do n\u00F3 c\u00F3 m\u00E0u \u0111en! V\u00F2ng tr\u00F2n n\u00E0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c g\u1ECDi l\u00E0 ch\u00E2n tr\u1EDDi s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n.",
        "StartTime": 97.7,
        "EndTime": 103.2
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.26b51c205ba944238889da4f1f20930f",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 21,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "the gravity will be so much stronger on the side closer to the black hole than at the other side",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "l\u1EF1c h\u1EA5p d\u1EABn \u1EDF ph\u00EDa g\u1EA7n h\u1ED1 \u0111en s\u1EBD m\u1EA1nh h\u01A1n r\u1EA5t nhi\u1EC1u so v\u1EDBi ph\u00EDa b\u00EAn kia,",
        "StartTime": 124.5,
        "EndTime": 130.9
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.282925cb37274da8af14eb11083bc715",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 20,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "As our spacecraft approaches it,",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Khi t\u00E0u v\u0169 tr\u1EE5 ti\u1EBFn l\u1EA1i g\u1EA7n,",
        "StartTime": 122.9,
        "EndTime": 124.5
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.28f7fcf866cd4101b707632dd2da9937",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 4,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "A black hole is an area of such immense gravity that nothing\u2014not even light\u2014can escape from it.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "H\u1ED1 \u0111en l\u00E0 m\u1ED9t v\u00F9ng c\u00F3 l\u1EF1c h\u1EA5p d\u1EABn kh\u1ED5ng l\u1ED3 \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c kh\u00F4ng g\u00EC \u2013 k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 \u00E1nh s\u00E1ng \u2013 c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 tho\u00E1t ra kh\u1ECFi n\u00F3.",
        "StartTime": 21.1,
        "EndTime": 29.5
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.34ecc8123e364afc958ec6454b5d6cd2",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 18,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "What would happen, you might wonder, if we took a spacecraft near a black hole\u2019s event horizon?",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "B\u1EA1n c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 t\u1EF1 h\u1ECFi: \u0111i\u1EC1u g\u00EC s\u1EBD x\u1EA3y ra n\u1EBFu ch\u00FAng ta \u0111\u01B0a m\u1ED9t con t\u00E0u v\u0169 tr\u1EE5 \u0111\u1EBFn g\u1EA7n ch\u00E2n tr\u1EDDi s\u1EF1 ki\u1EC7n c\u1EE7a h\u1ED1 \u0111en?",
        "StartTime": 109.2,
        "EndTime": 116
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.407800a384094a01a578ed2c4c91b79b",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 7,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "Here\u2019s where things get crazy.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "\u0110\u1EBFn \u0111\u00E2y m\u1ECDi chuy\u1EC7n tr\u1EDF n\u00EAn \u0111i\u00EAn r\u1ED3.",
        "StartTime": 41.6,
        "EndTime": 45
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
