      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.937a2f1f461647dab27495c8ceb07726",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 19,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "The answer\u2014spaghettification! That\u2019s the technical term, at least.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "C\u00E2u tr\u1EA3 l\u1EDDi l\u00E0 \u2013 s\u1EF1 m\u00EC \u1ED1ng h\u00F3a! \u00CDt nh\u1EA5t \u0111\u00F3 l\u00E0 thu\u1EADt ng\u1EEF chuy\u00EAn m\u00F4n.",
        "StartTime": 116,
        "EndTime": 122.9
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.9908e465fd1d4e4dade3db1aebf98562",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 8,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "All of that material left over from the explosion, many times the mass of our Sun, falls into an infinitely small point.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "To\u00E0n b\u1ED9 v\u1EADt ch\u1EA5t c\u00F2n l\u1EA1i sau v\u1EE5 n\u1ED5, n\u1EB7ng g\u1EA5p nhi\u1EC1u l\u1EA7n kh\u1ED1i l\u01B0\u1EE3ng M\u1EB7t Tr\u1EDDi c\u1EE7a ch\u00FAng ta, r\u01A1i v\u00E0o m\u1ED9t \u0111i\u1EC3m nh\u1ECF v\u00F4 h\u1EA1n.",
        "StartTime": 45,
        "EndTime": 53.2
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.a502c718b9584392a41b7ee55f08d017",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 3,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "Nothing is darker than a black hole.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "Kh\u00F4ng g\u00EC t\u1ED1i h\u01A1n m\u1ED9t h\u1ED1 \u0111en.",
        "StartTime": 18.8,
        "EndTime": 21.1
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.b29e396746924ef8ac5d73033496e6f2",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 15,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "The gravity on the inside of the circle is so strong that nothing can escape\u2014it sucks in everything, even light.",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "L\u1EF1c h\u1EA5p d\u1EABn b\u00EAn trong v\u00F2ng tr\u00F2n m\u1EA1nh \u0111\u1EBFn m\u1EE9c kh\u00F4ng g\u00EC tho\u00E1t ra \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c \u2013 n\u00F3 h\u00FAt m\u1ECDi th\u1EE9, k\u1EC3 c\u1EA3 \u00E1nh s\u00E1ng.",
        "StartTime": 89.2,
        "EndTime": 97.7
      },
      "references": {
        "LessonId": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.listening.b2.what-is-a-black-hole.c5e8d8019a384454bbf6211c8981669a",
      "kind": "ListeningTranscriptLine",
      "values": {
        "OrderIndex": 11,
        "Speaker": "Narrator",
        "Text": "trapped in a point smaller than the tip of a pin!",
        "VietnameseMeaning": "b\u1ECB nh\u1ED1t trong m\u1ED9t \u0111i\u1EC3m nh\u1ECF h\u01A1n \u0111\u1EA7u m\u1ED9t chi\u1EBFc kim!",
        "StartTime": 64.9,
        "EndTime": 69
